iler":false,"text":"暑假後轉入月光館學園主人公的班上。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"擅長「物理」系的攻擊，相對地沒有魔法攻擊手段，不過追加了「全攻率輸出」的裝置，啟動後一定時候能大力提升攻擊力、防禦力和命中、回避；可是經過一定時候機體過熱，大大下降了攻擊力、防禦力和命中、回避。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"初期Persona：帕拉狄翁/パラディオン"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"553"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/384b623afcfe468b7490b5886f7b045d2ff631918d28aa69bab771da5ee89c26.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/145538fc15c87ac95ae0fa2ec3a0cca22e9b9149a56ae7f848af5b526c4cd5ff.webp","width":74,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"坂本真綾","creatorId":"vndb:s5174","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5174","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5174","name":"坂本 真綾","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:440141:553:3877:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_554","characterName":"Ken Amada","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"554","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"440141"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Ken Amada","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"ab"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"私立月光馆学园初等部五年级生，因为意外失去了母亲这唯一的亲人。发现了人格面具能力之后加入了特别课外活动部。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年纪是成员中最为年幼的，但却有着不符合年龄的成熟，正义感很强，聰明敏銳。礙於經歷艱辛，拒絕作為孩子的身分，想尽快长大成人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"初期Persona：涅墨西斯/ネメシス"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"554"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a7c8de7fa670d2bde4462a526adc4e726741e89d30116f0cb00ad18e35f330bf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1